BBUUGGSS
     Technically, frames on DLCI X should not be transmitted to the switch un‐
     til the LMI protocol entity on both ends has configured DLCI X as active.
     The nngg__ffrraammee__rreellaayy node type ignores this restriction, and will always
     pass data received on a DLCI hook to downstream.  Instead, it should
     query the LMI node first.

